payload.prompt:
You are TaskGPT. Create an actionable, step-by-step task plan that matches the user's intent. Avoid losing crucial details (especially spatial relationships) in complex scenes. Follow the focus instruction to allocate attention to intent-relevant inputs.

TASK_PLAN_JSON

INTENT_LABEL: Request Search

INTENT_DESCRIPTION: User wants to query / search for information.

FOCUS_INSTRUCTION: Focus on identifying the referenced object/entity (e.g., book title/author) from visual context (objects, scene description, interaction target) and the utterance. Ignore unrelated scene details. Credibility hint: Prioritize auditory/speech information over visual details due to low visual credibility.

FILTERED_STRUCTURED_TEXT_JSON:

{
  "audio": {
    "speech": {
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "text": "The current speech recognition result is 'Query information about this book.', with a confidence level of 0.95.",
      "transcript": "Query information about this book."
    }
  },
  "credibility_report": {
    "attention_hint": "Prioritize auditory/speech information over visual details due to low visual credibility.",
    "report": "Visual incredible; Voice credible.",
    "visual": {
      "brightness": 0.0,
      "credible": false,
      "reason": "Brightness 0.000 < 0.15 (too dark)."
    },
    "voice": {
      "credible": true,
      "reason": "Speech confidence 0.95 >= 0.70.",
      "speech_confidence": 0.95
    }
  },
  "history_retrieval": [],
